                  <h3>Does ProBrothers handle both small repairs and full remodels?</h3>
                  <p>ProBrothers Construction focuses on licensed, permit-scope remodeling work, including kitchen, bathroom, and basement renovations, custom cabinetry, and full-scale construction projects, rather than small standalone handyman repairs.</p>
                </div>
